  1. m10-disconnect    M10  5 camera disconnects (PoE)                       gateway
  2. m11-power         M11  10 power cuts (operator switches the power)      workstation
  3. m10-kill          M10  Frigate killed 10 times                          gateway
  4. m10-reboot        M10  10 gateway reboots                               workstation
  5. m11-full-disk     M11  recording disk filled to its safe limit          gateway
  6. m11-missing-disk  M11  recording disk taken away and given back         gateway
  7. m11-corrupt       M11  one damaged segment, playback around it          gateway
  8. m12-integrity     M12  every segment since the matrix began             gateway

preflight:
